# Raw review dumps and telemetry are never committed.
# Mirrors the hygiene rule this project adopted after a 2026 PII incident:
# curated review notes are tracked, raw transcripts and run logs are not.
tasks/reviews/*.txt
tasks/reviews/*.json
tasks/reviews/*.jsonl
.codex-review.json
tasks/runs/

# NOTE: `tasks/rollups` is deliberately NOT ignored — roll-up summaries are
# meant to be tracked (tests/rollup-track/run.sh asserts this).

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
